  'Pressure and smoothing': "压感与平滑", 'Barrel roll turns the stamp': "笔身旋转会转动笔刷印记", 'Use global settings': "使用全局设置", 'Global': "全局", 'Firm': "硬", 'Flipbook preview': "翻页动画预览",
  'On this computer': "在此电脑上", 'Another folder': "其他文件夹", 'Type the full path of a folder you own, for example on an external drive.': "输入您自己的文件夹的完整路径,例如在外置硬盘上。",
