  'FormMorpheus is not allowed to use the microphone. Allow microphone access for FormMorpheus in your system settings (or the browser’s site settings), then press Try again.': "FormMorpheus 无权使用麦克风。请在系统设置（或浏览器的网站设置）中允许 FormMorpheus 访问麦克风，然后点按“重试”。",
  'No microphone was found. Plug one in or pick another input, then press Try again.': "未找到麦克风。请接入麦克风或选择其他输入，然后点按“重试”。",
  'The microphone is busy or unavailable: another app may be using it. Close it, then press Try again.': "麦克风正忙或不可用：可能有其他 App 正在使用。请将其关闭，然后点按“重试”。",
