  'No marker after the Playhead.': "播放头之后没有标记。", 'No marker before the Playhead.': "播放头之前没有标记。", 'There is already a marker on this frame.': "此帧上已有标记。", 'Only video, sound, Flipbooks and groups can change speed.': "只有视频、声音、翻页本和组可以更改速度。", 'A sound cannot hold a frame.': "声音无法定格帧。", 'Put the Playhead inside the content to hold a frame.': "将播放头放在内容内部以定格一帧。", 'Only pictures and video can be sized to the Stage.': "只有图片和视频可以适配舞台。", 'There is already a marker on that frame.': "该帧上已有标记。", 'That marker no longer exists.': "该标记已不存在。", 'That frame cannot be held.': "无法定格该帧。", 'That cannot be sized.': "无法调整它的大小。",
  'Brush Studio, real wet paint, sound recording and editing tools': "笔刷工作室、真实湿颜料、声音录制和编辑工具", 'Edit every part of a brush on a live drawing pad: stroke, taper, shape, grain, rendering, wet mix, color dynamics, pressure curves and more.': "在实时绘图板上编辑笔刷的每个部分:笔画、渐细、形状、颗粒、渲染、湿混合、颜色动态、压感曲线等。", 'Real wet paint': "真实湿颜料", 'Wet brushes pick up and mix the paint already on the canvas, and blue over yellow makes green.': "湿笔刷会拾取并混合画布上已有的颜料,蓝色涂在黄色上会变成绿色。", 'New tips and grains': "新的笔尖和颗粒", 'Pencils, charcoal, chalk, bristles and sponges now each have their own tip and paper grain.': "铅笔、炭笔、粉笔、鬃毛和海绵现在各有自己的笔尖和纸张颗粒。", 'Record a voice-over straight onto the Timeline, with takes, punch-in, fades, pan, mute and solo.': "直接在时间线上录制旁白,支持多条录音、插入录制、淡入淡出、声像、静音和独奏。", 'Editing tools': "编辑工具", 'Snapping, markers, speed, reverse and freeze, transitions between blocks, and fit or fill for imported media.': "吸附、标记、速度、倒放和定格、块之间的转场,以及导入媒体的适合与填充。", 'Guided tutorials that run inside the app, the manual, and a place to send ideas.': "在应用内运行的引导式教程、手册,以及发送想法的地方。", 'Keyboard and screen readers': "键盘和屏幕阅读器", 'Reach every control from the keyboard, with names for screen readers and reduced motion.': "用键盘即可操作每个控件,并为屏幕阅读器提供名称,支持减少动态效果。",
