  "{name}: proxy ready.": "{name}：代理已就绪。", "The proxy could not be made.": "无法制作代理。", "More: sample all layers, reload, deselect": "更多：取样所有图层、重新载入、取消选择", "QR code of the address": "地址二维码",
  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. In your tablet driver, turn on Windows Ink, restart the driver, then reopen FormMorpheus.": "你的数位板被识别为鼠标。请在数位板驱动中开启 Windows Ink，重启驱动，然后重新打开 FormMorpheus。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. In your tablet driver, turn on Windows Ink, restart the driver, then reopen FormMorpheus.": "此笔未报告压力。请在数位板驱动中开启 Windows Ink，重启驱动，然后重新打开 FormMorpheus。",
  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. Install your tablet's own driver (the system's generic one gives no pressure), then reopen FormMorpheus.": "你的数位板被识别为鼠标。请安装数位板自带的驱动（系统通用驱动不提供压力），然后重新打开 FormMorpheus。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. Install your tablet's own driver (the system's generic one gives no pressure), then reopen FormMorpheus.": "此笔未报告压力。请安装数位板自带的驱动（系统通用驱动不提供压力），然后重新打开 FormMorpheus。",
  "Your tablet is arriving as a mouse. On Linux the web view may not pass pressure through; an X11 session with your tablet's driver gives the best chance.": "你的数位板被识别为鼠标。在 Linux 上网页视图可能无法传递压力；使用数位板驱动的 X11 会话成功机会最大。",
  "This pen reports no pressure. On Linux the web view may not pass pressure through; an X11 session with your tablet's driver gives the best chance.": "此笔未报告压力。在 Linux 上网页视图可能无法传递压力；使用数位板驱动的 X11 会话成功机会最大。",
  "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}, tilt, twist.": "检测到笔：压力 {min} 至 {max}，倾斜，旋转。", "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}, tilt.": "检测到笔：压力 {min} 至 {max}，倾斜。",
  "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}, twist.": "检测到笔：压力 {min} 至 {max}，旋转。", "Pen detected: pressure {min} to {max}.": "检测到笔：压力 {min} 至 {max}。", "Count-in · {n}": "倒数 · {n}", "Action · {mode}": "动作 · {mode}",
  "Gain reduction": "增益衰减", "1:1 frame": "1:1 画框", "4:5 frame": "4:5 画框", "Title safe": "标题安全区", "Action safe": "动作安全区", "Vertical safe": "竖屏安全区",
  "Cloud folder": "云文件夹", "Cloud folder: not set": "云文件夹：未设置", "iCloud Drive": "iCloud Drive", "No cloud folder is set. Choose one in the Library Folder window.": "尚未设置云文件夹。请在资源库文件夹窗口中选择一个。",
  "Forward {n}x": "快进 {n}x", "Back {n}x": "快退 {n}x", "Pressure drives": "压力控制", "Turn the pen about its own axis. On a pen that reports no twist this has no effect.": "绕笔身轴线转动笔。对不报告旋转的笔无效。",
  "Trigger angle": "触发角度", "Camera shake": "镜头抖动", "New pattern": "新建图案", "Shake off": "关闭抖动", "Parallax depth": "视差深度", "Follow": "跟随", "Follow selection": "跟随所选", "Stop following": "停止跟随",
  "Depth sets how far the camera moves the selected track: 0 stays still, 1 moves normally, above 1 moves farther (a near layer).": "深度决定镜头移动所选轨道的幅度：0 不动，1 正常移动，大于 1 移动更远（近景图层）。",
