  "The start and the end of a taper take the same length while this is on.": "开启时，渐细的起点和终点长度相同。", "Turns every stamp by a random angle, up to a full turn. It does not move the stamps: Position scatter does.": "将每个图章随机旋转，最多一整圈。它不会移动图章：移动图章的是位置散布。",
  "Position scatter": "位置散布", "Moves every stamp a random way off the path, as a share of its size.": "按图章大小的比例，让每个图章随机偏离路径。", "How far the stamp turns with the direction of the stroke: 100 follows it, 0 holds still, -100 turns against it.": "图章随笔画方向转动的程度：100 完全跟随，0 保持不动，-100 反向转动。",
  "Improved": "改进", "How the stamp picture is sampled when it is drawn: None keeps hard pixels, Classic is smooth, Improved is smoothest.": "绘制时图章图像的采样方式：无保留硬像素，经典较平滑，改进最平滑。", "Rotation follows stroke": "旋转跟随笔画",
  "A moving grain turns with the direction of the stroke: 100 follows it, -100 turns against it.": "移动的颗粒随笔画方向转动：100 跟随，-100 反向。", "Burnt edges mode": "烧边模式", "How the darkened edge blends with the stroke.": "变暗的边缘如何与笔画混合。",
  "Stamp pixels at least this strong become solid and the rest clear: a hard edge with no soft fade.": "强度不低于此值的图章像素变为实心，其余变为透明：边缘生硬，没有柔和渐隐。", "The pen must lean past this angle before tilt changes the stamp.": "笔必须倾斜超过此角度，倾斜才会改变图章。",
  "Size compression": "大小压缩", "A leaning pen lays the stamp at its own size side by side, so the texture of the tip does not stretch.": "倾斜的笔会按图章自身大小并排放置，因此笔尖纹理不会被拉伸。", "The brush list and the exported thumbnail show one stamp of the brush instead of a stroke.": "画笔列表和导出的缩略图显示画笔的一个图章，而不是一条笔画。",
