  "Press and hold still on the picture to open the color loupe. Touch: fingers only. All: pen and mouse too.": "在图片上按住不动可打开取色放大镜。触控：仅手指。全部：笔和鼠标也可。", "Hide Eyedropper and Fill buttons": "隐藏吸管和填充按钮", "Pen and input": "笔与输入",
