  "The Theater, your wall of movies, covers the stage while no movie is open. What's New lists the recent additions and opens once after an update when the third choice is on.": "影院是你的影片墙，在没有打开影片时覆盖舞台。新功能会列出最近的新增内容，并在选中第三项时于更新后打开一次。",
  "Gallery shows your movies as a wall of posters with their names. Library adds a standing sidebar, filter and sort, and each movie's kind and age.": "画廊以海报墙的形式显示你的影片及名称。资源库增加固定侧边栏、筛选和排序，以及每部影片的类型和时长。",
  "A movie is in the Theater from the moment you make it, and every step you take is written to it within a moment. There is nothing to save. This interval is a safety net: it writes the open movie again if a write was ever missed.": "影片从创建起就在影院中，你的每一步操作都会在片刻内写入。无需保存。此间隔是一道保险：若有写入遗漏，会重新写入已打开的影片。",
