  "A second place for your movies: a folder your own sync service keeps in step. Copy to Cloud in the Theater sends a copy of a movie there; your library stays where it is.": "影片的第二个存放处：由你自己的同步服务保持同步的文件夹。影院中的“复制到云端”会把影片副本发送到那里；你的资源库保持原位。",
  "Keyboard layout": "键盘布局", "Keycaps show the letters of this layout. A shortcut belongs to a physical key, so it does not move when the layout changes.": "键帽显示此布局的字母。快捷键属于物理按键，因此布局改变时不会移动。", "Play the preview": "播放预览", "Animate this color": "为此颜色设置动画",
