  "Every gap closed, deeper effects and a calmer export": "补齐所有缺口，更深入的效果，更从容的导出", "Export progress": "导出进度", "Frames done, time elapsed and time left, with Cancel, and a chip that stays while you work.": "已完成的帧、已用时间和剩余时间，附带取消按钮，以及工作时常驻的小标签。",
  "More effects": "更多效果", "Ripple, Halftone, Outline, Gradient Map, Glitch, Kaleidoscope, Hue Range Shift and more, each with its own switch.": "波纹、半色调、轮廓、渐变映射、故障、万花筒、色相范围偏移等，每个都有独立开关。",
  "Titles": "标题", "Presets, gradient fill, glow, text on a path and animators over a range of letters, words or lines.": "预设、渐变填充、发光、路径文字，以及作用于一段字母、词语或行的动画器。",
  "Shake, follow and parallax depth per track, and a count-in before a Perform take.": "每条轨道的抖动、跟随与视差深度，以及演出拍摄前的倒数。", "Watercolor and oil": "水彩与油画",
  "Watercolor pools, darkens at its rim and bleeds while wet; oil frays at the ends and widens with tilt.": "水彩会积聚、边缘变深，湿时会晕开；油画笔触两端散开，倾斜时变宽。",
  "Hide one block, J K L shuttle, Space to pan, seconds and frames on the ruler, Flipbook cells on the blocks.": "隐藏单个块、J K L 穿梭、空格平移、标尺上的秒与帧、块上的翻页动画单元格。",
