  "You can turn this off any time in Preferences, Agents.": "你可以随时在“首选项 > 智能体”中关闭此功能。", "You decide what other programs may change": "其他程序可以更改什么，由你决定",
  "Your theme, language and preferences are kept from one launch to the next.": "你的主题、语言和偏好设置会在每次启动之间保留。", "create and change movies": "创建和更改影片",
  "ffmpeg was not found on this computer.": "在这台电脑上未找到 ffmpeg。", "ffmpeg {version}, installed on this computer": "ffmpeg {version}，安装在这台电脑上", "ffmpeg {version}, the downloaded build": "ffmpeg {version}，下载的版本",
  "iCloud Drive cannot be reached right now. Try again in a moment.": "暂时无法连接 iCloud 云盘。请稍后重试。",
  "iCloud Drive is off on this iPad, or no one is signed in to iCloud. Turn it on in the Settings app, under your name, then iCloud, and try again.": "此 iPad 上的 iCloud 云盘已关闭，或没有人登录 iCloud。请在“设置”App 中依次点按你的姓名、iCloud 将其打开，然后重试。",
  "iCloud Drive is on, but this app cannot reach its folder there. In the Settings app, under your name, then iCloud, check that iCloud Drive is allowed for FormMorpheus, and try again.": "iCloud 云盘已打开，但此应用无法访问其中的文件夹。请在“设置”App 中依次点按你的姓名、iCloud，确认已允许 FormMorpheus 使用 iCloud 云盘，然后重试。",
  "iCloud Drive is still being checked. Try again in a moment.": "仍在检查 iCloud 云盘。请稍后重试。", "make the title fade in over the first second": "让标题在第一秒内淡入", "movie": "影片",
